{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14259","headline":"陪韩院长韦河南同寻刘师不遇 · 窦牟","name":"陪韩院长韦河南同寻刘师不遇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙客诚难访，吾人岂易同。\n独游应驻景，相顾且吟风。\n药畹琼枝秀，斋轩粉壁空。\n不题三五字，何以达壶公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦牟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14259.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14259","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}